---
/**
 * ==============================================================================
 * TRADYLOR — SECCIÓN "EL MÉTODO" (home, #el-metodo)
 * ==============================================================================
 * Explica los 3 pasos del método editorial de Tradylor e integra de forma
 * nativa las 3 herramientas (Perfilador, Comparador, Dependiente IA) como
 * parte del Paso 3. Enlazada desde el mainNav (scroll suave) y desde
 * "Herramientas" en el header.
 * ==============================================================================
 */
---

<section class="method-section" id="el-metodo">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <div class="section-tag">Cómo trabajamos</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">El Método Tradylor</h2>
      <p class="section-desc max-700">
        Tres pasos, siempre en este orden, antes de recomendarte nada: agregamos, filtramos
        y por último te damos las mejores opciones junto a la tecnología para elegir sin dudas.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="method-steps">
      <!-- Paso 1 -->
      <article class="method-step">
        <div class="method-step-number">1</div>
        <div class="method-step-body">
          <div class="method-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <path d="M2 12h20" />
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="method-step-title">Agregamos y unificamos</h3>
          <p class="method-step-desc">
            Monitorizamos en tiempo real las principales tiendas de internet (grandes
            distribuidores y marketplaces). No tienes que comparar 5 webs distintas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Paso 2 -->
      <article class="method-step">
        <div class="method-step-number">2</div>
        <div class="method-step-body">
          <div class="method-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 3H2l8 9.46V19l4 2v-8.54L22 3z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="method-step-title">Filtramos el ruido y descartamos</h3>
          <p class="method-step-desc">
            Analizamos valoraciones reales, descartamos stock dudoso, productos de baja
            calidad o falsas ofertas. Solo pasa el filtro lo que realmente vale la pena,
            apoyándonos en un análisis riguroso de pros y contras de cada artículo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Paso 3 -->
      <article class="method-step method-step--tools">
        <div class="method-step-number">3</div>
        <div class="method-step-body">
          <div class="method-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="method-step-title">Te ofrecemos las mejores opciones, alternativas y tecnología de asistencia</h3>
          <p class="method-step-desc">
            El resultado del filtro se traduce en herramientas reales que puedes usar ahora
            mismo para decidir con seguridad:
          </p>

          <div class="method-tools-grid">
            <a href="/herramientas#perfilador" class="method-tool-card">
              <span class="method-tool-icon method-tool-icon--blue" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4" /><path d="M4 21v-1a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v1" /></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="method-tool-name">Perfilador de Compra</span>
              <span class="method-tool-desc">Define tus prioridades y filtra visualmente lo que encaja contigo.</span>
              <span class="method-tool-link">Probarlo ahora →</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/herramientas#comparador" class="method-tool-card">
              <span class="method-tool-icon method-tool-icon--amber" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="18" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="18" rx="1"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="method-tool-name">Comparador de Productos</span>
              <span class="method-tool-desc">Enfrenta cada producto a sus alternativas directas de otros comerciantes.</span>
              <span class="method-tool-link">Probarlo ahora →</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/herramientas#dependiente-ia" class="method-tool-card">
              <span class="method-tool-icon method-tool-icon--green" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z" /></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="method-tool-name">Dependiente IA</span>
              <span class="method-tool-desc">Tu asistente experto para guiarte en lenguaje natural hacia la elección perfecta.</span>
              <span class="method-tool-link">Probarlo ahora →</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <a href="/herramientas" class="method-cta">
            Ir al Centro de Herramientas
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .method-section {
    padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.03) 45%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .method-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 3.5rem auto 0;
  }

  .method-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 0%, rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.75) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    border-radius: 20px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .method-step:hover {
    border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .method-step-number {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
  }

  .method-step-body {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .method-step-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
    color: #60a5fa;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .method-step-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .method-step-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .method-step--tools .method-step-desc {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .method-tools-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .method-tool-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease;
  }

  .method-tool-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.5);
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08);
  }

  .method-tool-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .method-tool-icon--blue { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.16); color: #60a5fa; }
  .method-tool-icon--amber { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.16); color: #fbbf24; }
  .method-tool-icon--green { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.16); color: #34d399; }

  .method-tool-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .method-tool-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .method-tool-link {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #60a5fa;
  }

  .method-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .method-cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .method-tools-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .method-step {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 1.4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
